] {"environment":"dev","userId":1,"body":"{\"updates\":{\"cms\":{\"status\":\"expired\",\"releases\":[{\"version\":\"5.9.23\",\"critical\":false,\"notes\":\"<ul>\\n<li>Updated Yii to 2.0.55. (<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/craftcms\\/cms\\/issues\\/18833\\\">#18833<\\/a>)<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed a bug where the “Move…” asset index action was always disabled for files. (<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/craftcms\\/cms\\/issues\\/18798\\\">#18798<\\/a>)<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed a bug where nested elements would get soft-deleted after running the <code>entrify\\/global-set<\\/code> command on subsequent environments. (<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/craftcms\\/cms\\/issues\\/18767\\\">#18767<\\/a>)<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed a bug where row headings within Table fields weren’t getting statically translated in the control panel. (<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/craftcms\\/cms\\/discussions\\/13703\\\">#13703<\\/a>)<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed a bug where entry type chips within Matrix settings could be missing their action items.<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed a bug where custom field override settings’ Label, Handle, and Instructions fields could be missing their placeholder values.<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed a bug where site name and language values set to environment variables were getting replaced with their resolved values when installing Craft. (<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/craftcms\\/cms\\/issues\\/18780\\\">#18780<\\/a>)<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed a bug where site name values set to environment variables were getting replaced with their resolved values on save. (<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/craftcms\\/cms\\/pull\\/18789\\\">#18789<\\/a>)<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed a bug where browser tabs weren’t always getting refreshed when nested elements were reordered on another browser tab.<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed a bug where reordering nested elements on a draft could reorder them on the canonical owner element as well. (<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/craftcms\\/cms\\/issues\\/18751\\\">#18751<\\/a>)<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed a <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/craftcms\\/cms\\/security\\/policy#severity--remediation\\\">high-severity<\\/a> XSS vulnerability. (GHSA-24x4-j6x9-rfw5)<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed a <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/craftcms\\/cms\\/security\\/policy#severity--remediation\\\">moderate-severity<\\/a> XSS vulnerability. (GHSA-xrqc-p465-2xvg)<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\",\"date\":\"2026-05-11T00:00:00\"}],\"renewalUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/console.craftcms.com\\/accounts\\/me\\/licenses\\/cms\\/832671\",\"renewalPrice\":\"99.0000\",\"renewalCurrency\":\"USD\",\"phpConstraint\":\"^8.2\",\"packageName\":\"craftcms\\/cms\"},\"plugins\":{\"ckeditor\":{\"status\":\"eligible\",\"releases\":[],\"packageName\":\"craftcms\\/ckeditor\"},\"cookie-consent-banner\":{\"status\":\"eligible\",\"releases\":[],\"packageName\":\"adigital\\/cookie-consent-banner\"},\"freeform\":{\"status\":\"eligible\",\"releases\":[{\"version\":\"5.15.10\",\"critical\":false,\"notes\":\"<h3>Added<\\/h3>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added support for <em>Friendly Captcha<\\/em> spam protection captcha.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<h3>Fixed<\\/h3>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed a potential issue with screenshot handling for the <strong>Form Monitor<\\/strong> service.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\",\"date\":\"2026-05-11T00:00:00\"}],\"phpConstraint\":\"^8.0.2|^8.2.0\",\"packageName\":\"solspace\\/craft-freeform\"},\"obfuscator\":{\"status\":\"eligible\",\"releases\":[],\"packageName\":\"miranj\\/craft-obfuscator\"},\"seo\":{\"status\":\"eligible\",\"releases\":[],\"packageName\":\"ether\\/seo\"},\"sprig\":{\"status\":\"eligible\",\"releases\":[],\"packageName\":\"putyourlightson\\/craft-sprig\"}}},\"includeDetails\":true}"} 
